    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "bakari is a \"completed fullness\", for instance that's all you got because with that you didn't need any more.\ndake means that's all you got, but more would be better/ok/possible/,,,",
      "html": "bakari is a \"completed fullness\", for instance that's all you got because with that you didn't need any more.<br/>dake means that's all you got, but more would be better/ok/possible/,,,",
      "credits_raw": "duncane",
      "content_sha256": "4d68c1f0c5df829776b78c890f49387fc2334c9fc213ab139f68d546d3042788",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I second KWhazit's comment: there are most definitely two separate entries here. \nAlso need to beware: depending on meaning (\"just happened\"/\"nothing but\"), placement is different:\n\n食べたばかり -> I just ate (moments ago).\nばかり食べた -> All I/we/etc did was eating (and nothing else).\n\nFurthermore, I believe pronunciation/spelling: ばっかり is also valid (very often heard in speech).",
      "html": "I second KWhazit's comment: there are most definitely two separate entries here. <br/>Also need to beware: depending on meaning (\"just happened\"/\"nothing but\"), placement is different:<br/><br/>食べたばかり -&gt; I just ate (moments ago).<br/>ばかり食べた -&gt; All I/we/etc did was eating (and nothing else).<br/><br/>Furthermore, I believe pronunciation/spelling: ばっかり is also valid (very often heard in speech).",
      "credits_raw": "drdave",
      "content_sha256": "58171f80c604e69e256f07b0c5175c78c886611299d58bba1ffbee461856f2f8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "#5018\nその本を買ったばかりです。 \n\n#5019\n昨日アメリカから帰ってきたばかりです。\nI just got back from the US yesterday.\n\n#5027 Use kanji.\n彼は昨夜ここに到着したばかりです。\n\n#5028\nかわいそうにその少女は一日中泣いてばかりいました。\n\n#5029\nこの古い車はいつも壊れてばかりです。\n\n#5032\nPut \"、\" right after \"〜いるので.\"",
      "html": "#5018<br/>その本を買ったばかりです。 <br/><br/>#5019<br/>昨日アメリカから帰ってきたばかりです。<br/>I just got back from the US yesterday.<br/><br/>#5027 Use kanji.<br/>彼は昨夜ここに到着したばかりです。<br/><br/>#5028<br/>かわいそうにその少女は一日中泣いてばかりいました。<br/><br/>#5029<br/>この古い車はいつも壊れてばかりです。<br/><br/>#5032<br/>Put \"、\" right after \"〜いるので.\"",
      "credits_raw": "Nick",
      "content_sha256": "92bb4f20f4ee574085339f55fdfdf6e8dfe17373c3b5ce42d1ad5dfea9f768f9",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "How is this different from 'dake' or 'tada'?",
      "html": "How is this different from 'dake' or 'tada'?",
      "credits_raw": "Jarret",
      "content_sha256": "466995a02c85d63574c8ca3bd4f703a5e0ecae2d97f7fde021aa8f05fa1c5061",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I think this needs to be split into two separate entries.\n\nばかり (after a past-tense verb) in [#5018], [#5027], [#5034], and others, means that something has only just happened\n\nばかり (after a noun, -te form verb, etc.) in many of the other examples ([#5021], [#5028], [#5031], etc.) is more of a \"nothing but\", \"all it ever does is\", or \"all that's there is\" feeling.",
      "html": "I think this needs to be split into two separate entries.<br/><br/>ばかり (after a past-tense verb) in [#5018], [#5027], [#5034], and others, means that something has only just happened<br/><br/>ばかり (after a noun, -te form verb, etc.) in many of the other examples ([#5021], [#5028], [#5031], etc.) is more of a \"nothing but\", \"all it ever does is\", or \"all that's there is\" feeling.",
      "credits_raw": "KWhazit",
      "content_sha256": "a746f7e689567e8f529340a7b1da7d9ae18a12d779e13333abc509c4a5e1b3e9",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "１．正しいことばかり選べないそれくらいわかってる。\nMeaning something like I can't make but the wrong choice.\n~ばかり\n~てばかり\n\n２．着いたばかり。\nI just arrived.\n~たばかり",
      "html": "１．正しいことばかり選べないそれくらいわかってる。<br/>Meaning something like I can't make but the wrong choice.<br/>~ばかり<br/>~てばかり<br/><br/>２．着いたばかり。<br/>I just arrived.<br/>~たばかり",
      "credits_raw": "UmiLi",
      "content_sha256": "fd56c976e9f9ae43485eb143af0b86fdcf9b74b3690c419bb21c09d177af3235",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "KWhazit, good point!",
